 demo spec.More Frequent Chroma Catalysts – Chroma Catalysts are now granted at every tier instead of every other tier.Free Unit Hiring from Talents – Added free unit hires to talents such as Carrier Sprint and Carrier Hire Link","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T18:38:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114042692","verified_at":"2026-10-25T22:37:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5085400-1847286114037375","game_id":"steam-5085400","kind":"announcement","title":"Chroma Miners Demo Broadcasting!","summary":"Hello miners,This is Chroma Miners Demo play video.Hope you enjoy!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T17:36:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114037375","verified_at":"2026-10-23T21:20:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5085400-1847286114036477","game_id":"steam-5085400","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes – Ver. 0.0.1.6","summary":"Hello miners,Thank you for playing Chroma Miners!Balance ChangesImproved early and mid-game progression.Chromana requirement increases by 1 for every second Mortar Basics upgradeIncreased Digger's maximum mining power from Oversized PickaxeThanks for playing the demo.Feedback is always welcome!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T13:48:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114036477","verified_at":"2026-10-23T15:55:51Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5085400-1847286114033707","game_id":"steam-5085400","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes – Ver. 0.0.1.5","summary":"Hello miners,Thank you for playing Chroma Miners!Balance ChangesReduced Chromana requirements for Hammer units.Adjusted the prices of several units.New LanguagesAdded new languages: Chinese (Simplified), Chinese (Traditional), French, German, Italian, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese (Brazil), Russian, Spanish (Latin America), Spanish (Spain), and Thai.Thanks for playing the demo.Feedback is always welcome!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T17:49:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114033707","verified_at":"2026-10-22T18:08:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5085400-1847286114027798","game_id":"steam-5085400","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes – Ver. 0.0.1.4","summary":"Hello miners,Thank you for playing Chroma Miners!Early-game progression has been slightly accelerated, and mid-game pacing has been adjusted for a smoother experience.Thanks for playing the demo.Feedback is always welcome!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T07:11:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114027798","verified_at":"2026-10-21T09:42:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5085400-1846651706696274","game_id":"steam-5085400","kind":"update","title":"Demo Hotfix – Ver. 0.0.1.3","summary":"Hello miners,Thank you for playing Chroma Miners!A hotfix has been released to address an issue that prevented players from progressing in the game.If your game version is below Ver. 0.0.1.3 and the update hasn't downloaded, please restart Steam to download the latest patch.Sorry for the inconvenience.Thanks for playing the demo. Feedback is always welcome!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T18:00:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706696274","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:41:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5085400-1846651706696167","game_id":"steam-5085400","kind":"update","title":"Demo Patch Notes – Ver. 0.0.1.1","summary":"Hello,Thank you for playing Chroma Miners!Faster Early-Game ProgressionLowered the unlock requirement for the \"Bleach the World\"Digger – Sharpened Pickaxe cost reduced from 94 to 85.Carver cost reduced from 65 to 50.Carver building cost reduced from 151 to 121.Throwyard building cost reduced from 321 to 232.Balance ChangesGrappling Gear: Mining Power bonus increased from +15 to +25.Hammer Miner: Base Chromana requirement reduced from 1 to 0, allowing for more diverse unit choices early in the ga","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T17:34:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706696167","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:41:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5085400-1846651706693890","game_id":"steam-5085400","kind":"announcement","title":"Chroma Miners Demo is OUT NOW!","summary":"Hello,I'm thrilled to announce that the Chroma Miners Demo is now available!Guide your Chrobits as they mine, refine, and collect tons of colors! Automate their work, discover new synergies, and watch your mining operation grow in this relaxing incremental game.I hope you enjoy the demo! If you'd like to support the game's development, wishlisting Chroma Miners on Steam is one of the best ways to help!I'd like to hear your thoughts, so feel free to share your feedback.Happy mining :)","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T06:24:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693890","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:41:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","conten